      "settings": {
        "hero_eyebrow": "OUR STORY",
        "hero_heading": "About Us",
        "hero_subheading": "Custom Emblems. Real Stories.",
        "hero_text": "<p>At DizzyCustom, we believe every vehicle tells a story. Our mission is to help car and motorcycle owners make their ride truly their own with high-quality custom metal emblems — personalized, durable, and built to last.</p>",
        "hero_button_label": "Shop Custom Emblems",
        "hero_button_link": "/collections/dizzy-custom-emblems",
        "story_eyebrow": "PASSION DRIVES US",
        "story_heading": "Made for People Who Love Their Ride",
        "story_text": "<p>DizzyCustom was founded by automotive enthusiasts who believe details make the difference. We design and craft custom metal name emblems — personalized with your name, initials, or lettering — in a style that fits your vehicle and your personality.</p><p>Every emblem is made to order from premium stainless steel, built to last and easy to install in minutes. From daily drivers to show cars, we're here to help you add a personal touch that stands out.</p>",
        "story_button_label": "Our Story",
        "story_button_link": "/pages/about-us",
        "details_eyebrow": "MORE THAN JUST EMBLEMS",
        "details_heading": "It's a Lifestyle",
        "details_text": "<p>From the open road to your daily commute, custom emblems bring your personality to life. We're proud to be part of a community that values craftsmanship, individuality, and the freedom to make every ride your own.</p>",
        "details_button_label": "View Our Emblems",
        "details_button_link": "/collections/dizzy-custom-emblems",
